["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"84. 融了近4億的AI創業者在幹嘛？豈凡超的第一次訪談 conditioned generation RAG PMF MVP Foundation Model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-10-zhangxiaojun-模型公司终将消失-产品公司才刚开始/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpeVcobqnbak3XVOu7BfXTUxRjF4.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1210</span></div>\n<h2>模型公司終將消失，產品公司才剛開始</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">齊帆超認為模型本身沒法直接產生價值，將來不存在模型公司；他融了近4億卻主動放棄訓更大模型，轉而解決大模型輸出不確定性這個產品落地的最大卡點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI應用</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"83. 黃仁勳和3萬億美元英偉達是如何煉成的？ CUDA Riva 128 pilot in charge Top5\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-12-04-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有二号位-黄仁勋退休后谁来管60个人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnQ0d4e307Y8Lg3G6QMvE8BumhZF.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:44:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1204</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達沒有二號位：黃仁勳退休後誰來管60個人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達的戰略不是規劃出來的，是三個團隊兩個賽季、運送一整頭牛這些戰術被驗證後固定下來的；但公司至今沒有明顯的二號位。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"82. 和以太坊Vitalik Buterin聊：LLM的權力、技術哲學觀與貓 Layer 2 Farcaster Warpcast Polymarket Worldcoin\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-25-zhangxiaojun-ai-是中心化的权力-crypto-是它的解药/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c8ee10748c810b71-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1125</span></div>\n<h2>AI 是中心化的權力，Crypto 是它的解藥</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Vitalik 說 AI 的權力來自算力和數據，最好的 AI 就是最大的 AI，天然走向中心化；Crypto 唯一的作用是解決人和人之間的信任問題，所以 AI 參與 Crypto 的遊戲，而不是反過來。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI</span><span class=\"tag\">Crypto</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"81. 和李開復聊聊：如果美國形成AGI霸權，我們應該怎麼辦？ veneer Service as Software TCPMF HBM\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-11-10-zhangxiaojun-第一个做出agi的必然是垄断者-中国只能走生态这条路/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgd2vGQ01c_5mCG9B8zdbQON2o1t.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>第一個做出AGI的必然是壟斷者，中國只能走生態這條路</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">追求第一個碾壓對手的AGI，本質是商業霸權野心——他會用這個大腦發明手段維持壟斷。中國公司打不過這場燒錢遊戲，只能先把推理成本降下來，用生態當護城河。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI霸權</span><span class=\"tag\">推理成本</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"80. 和知乎周源聊，社會化編輯部、孤獨的悖論、AI與宿命 PMF LTV NPC Perplexity\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-31-zhangxiaojun-知乎的敌人不是抖音-是规模驱动的自己/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/efc635d64ccaa69d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1031</span></div>\n<h2>知乎的敵人不是抖音，是規模驅動的自己</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">周源復盤：上市後視頻、短內容兩次戰略回撤，根因是把社區當規模生意做；社區只能生態驅動，溢出式增長，不能擴列式增長。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容社區</span><span class=\"tag\">AI搜索</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"79. 特斯拉股價跌了，Uber卻漲了？漫談特斯拉Robotaxi大會 BOM CP / car partner Remote Assist option value 搖操作\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-13-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉发布会像年会-robotaxi-的故事讲给股东听/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d92f23bc8afbb6e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">58:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1013</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉發布會像年會：Robotaxi 的故事講給股東聽</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這場發布會沒有講任何技術，更像給老股東開的年會。真正值錢的是它把車閒置時間變現的兩條路：當 Robotaxi，或當分布式算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"78. 從蒸汽機到無人駕駛5｜談談自動駕駛創投過山車這8年 SPAC PS ratio Gartner 曲線\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-08-zhangxiaojun-自动驾驶创投八年-起步估值太高的公司几乎都死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/26c9d4bb25a4059d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:53</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1008</span></div>\n<h2>自動駕駛創投八年：起步估值太高的公司幾乎都死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">夢醒統計過，估值一億美金以上的非資源型前沿科技公司，好像還沒有很成功的案例。起步太高的公司會把錢花在維持賣相上，而不是猥瑣發育。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"77. 併購重組會興起嗎？和陸復斌聊他隱蔽做全球併購這5年 Two-Pizza Teams LBO CIFIUS AUM skin in the game\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-10-05-zhangxiaojun-他出价51亿买雅虎-输给了45亿的对手/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvgzF3dQz6pUuu7lmxDU7SYkR_C0.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>他出價51億買雅虎，輸給了45億的對手</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">陸復斌的offer比Apollo高6億美金，卻連一個答案都沒拿到。五年後對方當面告訴他：你沒有他們的高爾夫俱樂部會員。併購市場裡，價格之外還有一層看不見的門檻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">併購</span><span class=\"tag\">出海</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"76. 王小川返場談o1與強化學習：摸到了一條從快思考走向慢思考的路 CoT reward model DIKW Self Play RL scaling law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-25-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是转弯是进阶-快思考模型学会了慢思考/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/513984cf6692fc8c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">39:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0925</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是轉彎是進階：快思考模型學會了慢思考</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">王小川認為 o1 是範式升級而非進步退兩步——先有快思考，才能用強化學習讓它學會慢思考，這條路摸到了從語言走向智能的雛形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"75. 和OpenAI前研究員吳翼解讀o1：吹響了開挖第二座金礦的號角 PPO DQN RLHF self-play Scaling Law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-18-zhangxiaojun-o1-不是路线转弯-是-agi-梯子又多了几节/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/671dcf2cd1d9802c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:10</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>o1 不是路線轉彎，是 AGI 梯子又多了幾節</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">預訓練這座金礦快挖到頭了，強化學習是第二座礦。o1 的 preview 更像 GPT-3 時刻，能不能成為 ChatGPT 時刻要看正式版。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">o1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"74. 從蒸汽機到無人駕駛4｜Waymo和它的對手們：我暗中考察了四個月 DARPA Grand Challenge AlexNet 端到端 Moon Shot Project Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-11-zhangxiaojun-waymo-领先不是技术最强-是没犯过大错/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e35749cd8b4f7e70-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0911</span></div>\n<h2>Waymo 領先不是技術最強，是沒犯過大錯</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Waymo 起步最早、換過四任負責人、被業內一致看衰，最後卻成了 L4 唯一還在引領行業的公司——因為它活了下來，且沒犯 Cruise 和 Uber 那種致命錯誤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">Waymo</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"73. AGI範式大轉移：和廣密預言草莓、OpenAI o1和self-play RL｜全球大模型季報4 Self-Play RL Scaling Law reward model RLHF MOE DiT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-05-zhangxiaojun-不做强化学习的公司-下一波浪潮里可能跑不出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/27f4c2e89ae9ca7b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0905</span></div>\n<h2>不做強化學習的公司，下一波浪潮裡可能跑不出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">語言預訓練遇到瓶頸後，硅谷最核心的幾百名研究者已把資源壓注到 self-play RL 上，它用推理算力換訓練算力，讓模型自己探索出邏輯推理能力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"72. 從蒸汽機到無人駕駛3｜和孟醒聊特斯拉FSD進化史 MPI / MPCI BEV + Transformer VLM Remote Assist garbage in garbage out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-09-02-zhangxiaojun-特斯拉fsd只是辅助驾驶的gpt-3时刻-不是l4/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlUGppFTCiD6i4x1NEFWXtpkFo2M.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0902</span></div>\n<h2>特斯拉FSD只是輔助駕駛的GPT-3時刻，不是L4</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">端到端讓FSD一年內連升數版，但45分鐘接管一次和Waymo的10萬公里一次關鍵接管差約1000倍。L2要的是最優接管率，不是越低越好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">特斯拉FSD</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"71. 和樓天城聊聊Robotaxi和ACRush：“L2做得越厲害，離L4越遠” contest based metric system MPX Hold hard end-to-end BEV Robotaxi\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-08-16-zhangxiaojun-l2做得越好离l4越远-无人驾驶的路线之争/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d093a1c7aa808aa9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>L2做得越好離L4越遠，無人駕駛的路線之爭</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小馬智行樓天城認為 L2 和 L4 目標不同：L2 用戶只要夠用、成本更低，做得越好反而離 L4 越遠；L4 要的是萬小時不出事，還得有一把評價好壞的尺子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">Robotaxi</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"70. 和何小鵬聊，FSD、“在血海游泳”、亂世中的英雄與狗熊 AD BOM Robot Taxi OTA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-07-16-zhangxiaojun-何小鹏-大模型对小型公司不利-越强越多数据越多费用/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/514c23c30b63a46b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0716</span></div>\n<h2>何小鵬：大模型對小型公司不利，越強越多數據越多費用</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大 AI 的網絡效應是：越強所以越多數據，越多數據所以越多費用，越多費用所以要賣越多車去支持這個體系。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">自動駕駛</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"69. 口述全球大模型這半年：Perplexity突然火爆和尚未爆發的AI應用生態 PMF RAG MOE Scaling Law Latency\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-23-zhangxiaojun-ai应用没爆发-不是产品问题是模型问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88869a8f5db7fb1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0623</span></div>\n<h2>AI應用沒爆發，不是產品問題是模型問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">GPT-4 出來一年多，硅谷主流 VC 投出的 AI 應用只有 Perplexity 一家跑到 2000 多萬月活；90% 的原因是只基於 GPT-4 的能力不夠，只能做信息組合，做不了長距離推理。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 應用</span><span class=\"tag\">Perplexity</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"68. 和MiniMax天使投資人聊，MiniMax幕後故事和大模型資本撲克牌 Club Deal corner cases MOE scale up L4\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-06-10-zhangxiaojun-minimax-第一位投资人-大厂降价是看牌-创业公司只能认赔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6400a25bba631a90-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0610</span></div>\n<h2>MiniMax 第一位投資人：大廠降價是看牌，創業公司只能認賠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大廠做模型可以不賺錢、從雲計算把錢掙回來，創業公司被拖進價格戰卻無處回血；MiniMax 的解法是模型質量第一，靠海外 2C 產品收錢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">融資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"67. 談談黃仁勳搭建的組織系統：分布式操作系統，“就像一臺GPU” Conway&#x27;s Law context, not control Zero Billion Dollar Market chiplet\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-31-zhangxiaojun-英伟达没有五年计划-黄仁勋把公司做成了一台-gpu/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f0eed2af727e6cd8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0531</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達沒有五年計劃：黃仁勳把公司做成了一臺 GPU</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳的八條反常識管理法不是散點，而是一套分布式操作系統：60 個高管直接彙報、薪酬精確到一美分相同、不做一對一、不做計劃——組織溝通結構決定了產品架構。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"66. 和李志飛聊IPO、GPT-4o和你不知道的前沿科技創業的痛 VLA DiT In Context Learning codec P&amp;L\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-05-23-zhangxiaojun-前沿科技创业的痛-上市那天-我觉得对不起这12年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b6a457f38ae1bd4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:29:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>前沿科技創業的痛：上市那天，我覺得對不起這12年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出門問問創始人李志飛說，敲鐘那一刻他想的不是榮耀，而是「今天這個結果對得起我12年受的磨難嗎——對不起」。他把前沿科技創業的宿命總結成一塊隨時會化的浮冰。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">前沿科技創業</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"65. 風險投資的鑰匙失靈了嗎？和夢秋聊：蟄伏、更少人的遊戲和齧齒動物 明股實債 check size power law foundation model AI for science AI for coding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-22-zhangxiaojun-vc-的以小博大逻辑失效了-我们改做侏罗纪的老鼠/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3a24508c632217d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0422</span></div>\n<h2>VC 的以小博大邏輯失效了，我們改做侏羅紀的老鼠</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美元 VC 的募資端和退出端同時被掐斷，靠十個 check 裡中兩三個的槓桿故事講不下去了。清流資本的選擇是：要麼投一兩年就能變現的現在學，要麼投七到十年的未來學，中間地帶最難。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span><span class=\"tag\">AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"64. 和廣密聊AGI大基建時代：電+芯片=產出智能 Scaling Law Agent 主權 AI T5T Killer App\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-17-zhangxiaojun-agi-是马拉松-物理硬件成了最大瓶颈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9219795544d999cf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0417</span></div>\n<h2>AGI 是馬拉松：物理硬件成了最大瓶頸</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">去年以為加 GPU 加數據就能到 AGI，今年發現單數據中心加到 3.2 萬卡就撞牆，美國能源基建還是四五十年前規劃的——AGI 時間表被物理世界拖長了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AGI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"63. 商業口述史：中資到海外買買買的大時代，以430億美元併購先正達為最高潮 Synergy management retention offtake EV/EBITDA DCF HSE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-07-zhangxiaojun-430亿美元买先正达-中国买买买大时代的高潮与落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FimDPSiKE_QPoV0SwdcF8TQUYo5I.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:43:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0407</span></div>\n<h2>430億美元買先正達：中國買買買大時代的高潮與落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國企業海外併購的黃金期起於2009年官方定調、止於2017年逆全球化，先正達是最高潮也是終點；買得便宜不如買得對路，整合才是成敗關鍵。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">海外併購</span><span class=\"tag\">先正達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"62. 你們要的朱嘯虎，來了 PMF Llama POC C2C 視頻電話\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-04-01-zhangxiaojun-朱啸虎-中国-aigc-应用已经大爆发-只是都藏在-to-b-里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a9e53f96035921e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">52:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0401</span></div>\n<h2>朱嘯虎：中國 AIGC 應用已經大爆發，只是都藏在 to B 裡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎說中國 AIGC 應用已經大爆發，只是都發生在企業服務裡：外賣意外險賠付率從 150 塊降到 60 塊，視頻面試一年做到 100 萬人次，消費者根本看不見。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span><span class=\"tag\">風險投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"61. 和王小川聊再創業這一年：回應朱嘯虎與中國AGI第三種可能 TPF PMF RWS 太虛幻境\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-03-17-zhangxiaojun-王小川-理想上慢一步-落地上快三步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvUl4pr-OanrS0bGLwfG_OCvkMQd.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0317</span></div>\n<h2>王小川：理想上慢一步，落地上快三步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎看現實、楊植麟看技術，王小川說兩人都只摸到大象一條腿。他要做的是造人，醫療是那個頂天立地的場景。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AGI</span>\n</div></div></a>"]